{"content_hash": "de438fff5c269163", "version_id": 1052, "article_id": 107, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Xiaomi launches bigger Mijia smart fish tank 2 Pro", "title_zh": "小米推出更大的米家智能鱼缸2 Pro", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119023", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571008887538-b36bb32f4571?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8cHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTU0OTc5NDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by sporlab on Unsplash", "author": "sporlab", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@sporlab?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/pair-of-blue-and-white-adidas-running-shoes-XiZ7pRvCzro?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(206, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(244, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "4886abeeaa35"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-24", "word_count": 153, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Xiaomi has a new smart fish tank. The Mijia Smart Fish Tank 2 Pro is bigger and easier to use. It is the third tank in the Mijia family.", "lead_zh": "小米推出了一款新的智能鱼缸。米家智能鱼缸2 Pro更大，也更容易使用。它是米家系列中的第三款鱼缸。", "preview": "The new tank holds about 30 litres of water. The first tank held only 20 litres. This gives fish more room to swim and more space for plants", "preview_zh": "新鱼缸可装约30升水。第一款鱼缸只能装20升。这让鱼有更多游动的空间，也为水草和石头留出更多位置。玻璃非常清澈，所以水看起来很明亮。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1035, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 47.35, "size_bytes": 285120, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 48.7, "size_bytes": 293184, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 51.75, "size_bytes": 311472, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 44.95, "size_bytes": 270720, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 48.25, "size_bytes": 290448, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/1052.json", "paragraphs": ["The new tank holds about 30 litres of water. The first tank held only 20 litres. This gives fish more room to swim and more space for plants and rocks. The glass is very clear, so the water looks bright.", "The filter is now on the top. It keeps fish waste out of the water. The water pump is stronger too, so the water moves faster and has more air. A small spotlight makes the plants and rocks look beautiful.", "The Mijia app still controls the tank. You can set the light, the pump and the feeding time. The app can also suggest settings for different kinds of fish. This helps people who are new to keeping fish.", "Some problems remain. Water can fog up the glass inside the tank. Cleaning the filter still takes time. But for many users, the bigger size and better light make the 2 Pro a good upgrade."], "paragraphs_zh": ["新鱼缸可装约30升水。第一款鱼缸只能装20升。这让鱼有更多游动的空间，也为水草和石头留出更多位置。玻璃非常清澈，所以水看起来很明亮。", "过滤器现在位于顶部。它能把鱼的排泄物挡在水外。水泵也更强了，所以水流更快，含氧量更高。一盏小聚光灯让水草和石头看起来很美。", "米家应用仍然可以控制鱼缸。你可以设置灯光、水泵和喂食时间。应用还能为不同种类的鱼推荐设置。这能帮助刚开始养鱼的人。", "一些问题仍然存在。水会让鱼缸内侧的玻璃起雾。清洗过滤器仍然需要时间。但对许多用户来说，更大的尺寸和更好的灯光让2 Pro成为一次不错的升级。"], "body": "The new tank holds about 30 litres of water. The first tank held only 20 litres. This gives fish more room to swim and more space for plants and rocks. The glass is very clear, so the water looks bright.\n\nThe filter is now on the top. It keeps fish waste out of the water. The water pump is stronger too, so the water moves faster and has more air. A small spotlight makes the plants and rocks look beautiful.\n\nThe Mijia app still controls the tank. You can set the light, the pump and the feeding time. The app can also suggest settings for different kinds of fish. This helps people who are new to keeping fish.\n\nSome problems remain. Water can fog up the glass inside the tank. Cleaning the filter still takes time. But for many users, the bigger size and better light make the 2 Pro a good upgrade.", "body_zh": "新鱼缸可装约30升水。第一款鱼缸只能装20升。这让鱼有更多游动的空间，也为水草和石头留出更多位置。玻璃非常清澈，所以水看起来很明亮。\n\n过滤器现在位于顶部。它能把鱼的排泄物挡在水外。水泵也更强了，所以水流更快，含氧量更高。一盏小聚光灯让水草和石头看起来很美。\n\n米家应用仍然可以控制鱼缸。你可以设置灯光、水泵和喂食时间。应用还能为不同种类的鱼推荐设置。这能帮助刚开始养鱼的人。\n\n一些问题仍然存在。水会让鱼缸内侧的玻璃起雾。清洗过滤器仍然需要时间。但对许多用户来说，更大的尺寸和更好的灯光让2 Pro成为一次不错的升级。", "text": "The new tank holds about 30 litres of water. The first tank held only 20 litres. This gives fish more room to swim and more space for plants and rocks. The glass is very clear, so the water looks bright. The filter is now on the top. It keeps fish waste out of the water. The water pump is stronger too, so the water moves faster and has more air. A small spotlight makes the plants and rocks look beautiful. The Mijia app still controls the tank. You can set the light, the pump and the feeding time. The app can also suggest settings for different kinds of fish. This helps people who are new to keeping fish. Some problems remain. Water can fog up the glass inside the tank. Cleaning the filter still takes time. But for many users, the bigger size and better light make the 2 Pro a good upgrade.", "vocab": [{"word": "tank", "pos": "noun", "zh": "鱼缸", "note": "fish tank 指养鱼的缸", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "litre", "pos": "noun", "zh": "升", "note": "容量单位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "filter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "过滤器", "note": "净水设备", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pump", "pos": "noun", "zh": "水泵", "note": "抽水的机器", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spotlight", "pos": "noun", "zh": "射灯", "note": "集中照明的灯", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "app", "pos": "noun", "zh": "手机应用", "note": "application 的简称", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "upgrade", "pos": "noun", "zh": "升级", "note": "也可作动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fog up", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "起雾", "note": "玻璃表面蒙上水汽", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T05:25:44.322164", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.525, "sm": 350, "em": 524, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "tank", "s": 0.525, "e": 0.825, "sm": 525, "em": 824, "cs": 8, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "holds", "s": 0.825, "e": 1.112, "sm": 825, "em": 1112, "cs": 13, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "about", "s": 1.113, "e": 1.437, "sm": 1112, "em": 1437, "cs": 19, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "30", "s": 1.438, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1437, "em": 1774, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "litres", "s": 1.775, "e": 2.112, "sm": 1775, "em": 2112, "cs": 28, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "of", "s": 2.112, "e": 2.2, "sm": 2112, "em": 2199, "cs": 35, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "water", "s": 2.2, "e": 2.85, "sm": 2200, "em": 2849, "cs": 38, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": ".", "s": 2.85, 